            "content": "---\nid: conduct-rewrite\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Rewrite the conduct contract as rules\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0008. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nConduct reads as prose and is cited by paragraph.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Restate every clause as a numbered rule.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Every citation in the workflow layer names a rule number.\n\n## Session log\n",
